  Phase 1 + 1.5 measurement is conclusive that the right column has
  the smallest per-pixel diff in the image.
- DO NOT cite "FMA precision" for the deficit (per W44-66 user
  correction).
- DO NOT mark clic_097cb426 as FIXED in any cjxl-parity ledger
  without re-running the Phase 1.5 region SSIM2 bench. The 9-cell
  per-region grid is the canonical diagnostic.
- DO NOT spawn yet another "what is the strategy / qac difference"
  diagnostic — they MATCH. The bug is in DC values or sub-pixel CfL,
  not strategy/AC quantization.
